    <l n="62" para="true">2. Quid moribus?</l>
    <l n="63" para="true">3. Quid jure Canonico?</l>
    <l n="64" type="heading" level="3" para="true">§. 13.</l>
    <l n="65" para="true">1. Mandato repugnat merces, non salarium.</l>
    <l n="66" para="true">2. Bacchovius reprehenditur.</l>
